OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 DEC
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GVenna is back with his third pick
OL,12,     Gof the week, and tonight he goes
OL,13,     Gfor a release that features some
OL,14,     Gof the contemporary artists he
OL,15,     Greveres.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GThe RTV Slovenia Symphony
OL,18,     GOrchestra are joined by pianist
OL,19,     GDejan Lazic for Chopin's Piano
OL,20,     GConcerto no 2 in F minor, as well
OL,21,     Gas Mendelssohn's 'Reformation'
OL,22,     GSymphony and Finlandia.
